# Density-head lab (30.09): token caches are ~28 GB each and never go to git; per-epoch resume state
# and the aggregated reports (regenerated by `python main_density_lab.py --report`) stay local so
# commits from the server and the workstation never collide. Per-seed results (metrics.csv,
# summary.json, head.pt) ARE committed — git is how results travel between the two machines.
data/wedge_band_tokens/
experiments/density_head_lab/**/state.pt
experiments/density_head_lab/*/summary.csv
experiments/density_head_lab/WYNIKI.md
experiments/density_head_lab/wyniki.json
